{"text":"And so I followed up, I said, what is it that the Four Seasons is doing that would make you say to me, I love my job? And without skipping a beat, Noah said, throughout the day, managers will walk past me and ask me how I'm doing, if there's anything that I need to do my job better. He said, not just my manager, any manager. And then he said something magical. He says, I also work at Caesar's Palace. At Caesar's Palace, the managers are trying to make sure we're doing everything right. They catch us when we do things wrong. He says, when I go to work there, I like to keep my head under the radar and just get through the day so I can get my paycheck. He says, here at the Four Seasons, I feel I can be myself.","words":[{"text":"And","start":0.0,"end":0.48},{"text":"so","start":0.48,"end":0.64},{"text":"I","start":0.64,"end":0.8},{"text":"followed","start":0.8,"end":1.0},{"text":"up","start":1.0,"end":1.22,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":1.34,"end":1.34},{"text":"said","start":1.34,"end":1.5,"punct":","},{"text":"what","start":1.86,"end":1.9},{"text":"is","start":1.9,"end":2.02},{"text":"it","start":2.02,"end":2.18},{"text":"that","start":2.18,"end":2.26},{"text":"the","start":2.26,"end":2.4},{"text":"Four","start":2.4,"end":2.64},{"text":"Seasons","start":2.64,"end":2.96},{"text":"is","start":2.96,"end":3.24},{"text":"doing","start":3.24,"end":3.64},{"text":"that","start":3.64,"end":4.44},{"text":"would","start":4.44,"end":4.58},{"text":"make","start":4.58,"end":4.82},{"text":"you","start":4.82,"end":5.04},{"text":"say","start":5.04,"end":5.3},{"text":"to","start":5.3,"end":5.54},{"text":"me","start":5.54,"end":5.92,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":6.02,"end":6.52},{"text":"love","start":6.52,"end":6.8},{"text":"my","start":6.8,"end":7.16},{"text":"job","start":7.16,"end":7.48,"punct":"?"},{"text":"And","start":8.02,"end":8.1},{"text":"without","start":8.1,"end":8.28},{"text":"skipping","start":8.28,"end":8.54},{"text":"a","start":8.54,"end":8.72},{"text":"b